## 1.3 Who Is Affected by ReMeal
  The users of ReMeal consist primarily of four groups. The first group is budget-conscious students a
nd hungry users, who mainly purchase discounted "Surprise Boxes" before closing time to save on meal
costs. The second group is small bakery owners, who use the platform to sell their unsold food at a 
discount for clearance. The third group is delivery workers, who are responsible for picking up the
orders from the stores within specific time windows and delivering them to the users. The fourth group 
is the software developers and maintenance staff, who build and update the online trading system that connects merchants with consumers.
